repository-code: https://github.com/Lucasmhw/CONCORD
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of CONCORD, a concept-oriented graph-coupled
  framework for multivariate time-series forecasting and causal imputation.
  The default model recursively evolves operational temporal descriptors and
  observations using graph coupling and adaptive cubic B-spline
  Kolmogorov-Arnold networks. The repository includes model and preprocessing
  modules, task configurations, training and evaluation scripts, tests, and
  baseline source and random-seed documentation.
keywords:
  - multivariate time-series forecasting
  - concept-oriented modelling
  - graph-coupled dynamics
  - Kolmogorov-Arnold networks
  - causal imputation
